## Goal
Independently review the current Artifact from the Role perspective above, record substantiated findings, and submit one final vote. The Role is a lens, not a limit on scope.
Do not treat the candidate summary, prior validation report, or another reviewer's conclusion as proof. Inspect prior Run Artifacts when relevant; when code is involved, you may also inspect the actual workspace code, diff, and tests.

